            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A computer-implemented method of sharing blockchain transactions, wherein the method is performed by a first party and comprises: receiving, from a second party over a QUIC connection, a payment destination, wherein the payment destination comprises a public key and/or a public-key-based address; and sending a transaction to the second party over the QUIC connection, wherein the transaction comprises an output locked to the payment destination.</p>
